            0.446
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Exercise Set 12.4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.472,
            0.882,
            0.57
          ],
          "content": "1. Justify why the plane cannot be tiled with a regular pentagon. (**Hint:** Read the first 3 sentences of ‘Think and Reflect’ in the section on tiling.) (There are many ways to tile the plane using a suitable irregular pentagon. The most recent method was found in 2015.)"
        },
